aja   1 Dashboard   2 Config
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Keys

  1           Dashboard
  2           Config
  ?           this list; Esc closes it
  q, Ctrl-C   quit (a run in progress keeps running)
  s           the setup checklist (from the Dashboard)

Setup checklist

  Enter       fix the selected check: the init wizard, LinkedIn sign-in, or the Config tab
  i           import from the Python bot
  r           check again
  Esc         back to the tabs (once there is a config file)

Config

  ↑ ↓, k j    move; PgUp PgDn, g G jump
  Enter       edit the setting or secret, then Enter saves
  Esc         cancel the edit






────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
esc closes the list · q quit